      "The Xiaomi Phone",
      "",
      "I am a cell phone. My name is Xiaomi, and you can call me the Xiaomi phone. ",
      "",
      "My owner is called Daxing. He is 18 years old this year.",
      "He is a  senior high school student. This year he is in the third year of senior high school.",
      "Daxing likes me, and I also like Daxing.",
      "",
      "In the mornings, Daxing says, “Where is my phone?”. ",
      "",
      "In the afternoons, Daxing says, “Where is my phone? I want to watch a movie.” ",
      "",
      "In the evenings, Daxing says, “Where is my phone? I want to go on Facebook.”",
      "",
      "When I hear him calling for me, I am so happy! I say, “I am here! I am here!”"
